    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d475">

                <pb facs="0519" n="505" sameAs="frus:frus1944v07/pg505"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">103.9169/7–644: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Bolivia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">McLaughlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">La Paz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-07-06T19:00:00-04:00">July 6, 1944—7
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 9:32 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1329. For Department and Crowley and Dodson FEA<anchor n="99" xml:id="d475-f1"/>
                    from Embassy Wynn and Acton. Department’s 714, July l,<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d475-f2"/> and previous, export control. Bolivia Country Agency
                    today accepted proposed roll-back of Decentralization Plan unconditionally
                    effective July 10. Despatch follows.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McLaughlin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
